Package: llutils
Title: Fast Parallel Matching for Large Vectors
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Lukas", "Jung", , "jung-lukas@gmx.net", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A multithreaded match() and %in% for large integer vectors,
    written in Rust. Falls back to base R below the size where threads pay
    off.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
